格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH 插件看板 · DeepSeek Harness 插件生态可视化（shadcn/ui，每日自动构建部署）","id":"gh:1333785706","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-dashboard","slug":"baiyun200/dsh-dashboard","topics":["dashboard","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","shadcn-ui","visualization"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH 插件看板 · DeepSeek Harness 插件生态可视化（shadcn/ui，每日自动构建部署）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Plugin Dashboard"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Language**: English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A visualization dashboard for the **DeepSeek Harness plugin ecosystem**, built on the GitHub `dsh-pl"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ugin` topic.\nBuilt with **shadcn/ui** + **Recharts** — bilingual (中文 / English) interface: stat card"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"s, charts, category overview, and a searchable / filterable / sortable plugin table with a detail dr"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"awer. On first visit the language follows your browser; you can switch it anytime from the header."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> DeepSeek Harness: Everything is a Plugin. Models, tools, sandboxes, session stores, UI, even the a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"gent loop itself can be replaced and extended with plugins."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Live Site"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **GitHub Pages**: <https://baiyun200.github.io/dsh-dashboard/>　[](https://baiyun200.github.io/dsh-"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"dashboard/)\n- Built and deployed daily by GitHub Actions: re-fetches the `dsh-plugin` topic at 01:30"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" UTC (09:30 Beijing time) and publishes; pushing to `main` or a manual trigger (Actions → 每日构建 & 部署 "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"GitHub Pages → Run workflow) also redeploys."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- 👁️ **Visitor counter**: cumulative GitHub Pages visits shown in the top-right corner (third-party "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"counter)\n- 🌐 **Bilingual UI (中文/English)**: auto-detects your browser language on first visit; switc"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"h anytime from the header"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- 📊 **Stat cards**: repos in topic, curated plugins, total stars/forks, active in 30 days, languages"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"\n- 📈 **Charts**:\n- Language distribution donut\n- Plugin growth trend (new repos per month, last 12 m"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"onths)\n- Star size distribution (long-tail histogram)\n- Top 10 by stars\n- 🗂️ **Category overview**: "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"11 categories following awesome-dsh-plugin / awesome-deepseek-harness; click to filter\n- 🔍 **Plugin "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"table**: search (name / author / description / topic tags), category & language filters, sorting, cu"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"rated-only toggle, pagination\n- 📋 **Detail drawer**: description, stats, topic tags, timeline, one-c"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"lick copy of the install command\n- 🔄 **Live refresh**: re-fetch topic data from the GitHub API (Top "},{"id":"p11s8","text":"300) in the browser, with graceful fallback on failure\n- 🌓 **Light/dark theme**: dark by default, sw"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"itchable and remembered"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Data Pipeline"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The built-in snapshot comes from `scripts/build-data.mjs`, fed by the GitHub API snapshots and curat"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ed lists under `data/raw/`:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The **Refresh** button in the top-right corner calls the GitHub API directly from the browser (cache"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ton in the top-right corner calls the GitHub API directly from the browser (cached in localStorage)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Quality Checks"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Project Structure"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Disclaimer"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"This dashboard is a community project, not affiliated with DeepSeek; inclusion does not imply offici"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"al endorsement. Installing third-party plugins executes their code — review the source yourself."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Star Growth Trend"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
